#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:furniture_store.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can access every installed App in your Odoo database on your main "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງທຸກໆແອັບທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ Odoo ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ຈາກໜ້າຈໍຫຼັກ (Dashboard)."

#. module: furniture_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:furniture_store.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can merge multiple Purchase Orders for the same vendor as long as they "
"haven't been confirmed yet.<strong/><b/><br/>"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດລວມໃບສັ່ງຊື້ຫຼາຍສະບັບສຳລັບຜູ້ສະໜອງດຽວກັນໄດ້ ຕາບໃດທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນ.<strong/><b/"
"><br/>"

#. module: furniture_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:furniture_store.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can process <strong>partial deliveries </strong>by adjusting the "
"quantity. Odoo will automatically generate a backorder for any remaining "
"items.<b/><br/>"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດດຳເນີນ <strong>ການຈັດສົ່ງບາງສ່ວນ </strong>ໄດ້ ໂດຍການປັບຈຳນວນ. Odoo "
"ຈະສ້າງລາຍການຄ້າງສົ່ງ (Backorder) ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບສິນຄ້າທີ່ຍັງເຫຼືອ.<b/><br/>"

#. module: furniture_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:furniture_store.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can process all inventory transactions directly from the <strong>Barcode "
"App</strong> if you're using a <strong>mobile device or scanner.</strong><b/"
"><br/>"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດດຳເນີນທຸລະກຳສາງສິນຄ້າທັງໝົດໄດ້ໂດຍກົງຈາກ <strong>ແອັບບາໂຄດ</strong> "
"ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ <strong>ອຸປະກອນມືຖື ຫຼື ເຄື່ອງສະແກນ.</strong><b/><br/>"

#. module: furniture_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:furniture_store.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You didn't import demo data? You can still do it. Go to Apps &gt; Industries "
"&gt; Upgrade your Library package and select the relevant checkbox"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ນຳເຂົ້າຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງບໍ? ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້. ໄປທີ່ ແອັບ (Apps) &gt; ອຸດສາຫະກຳ "
"(Industries) &gt; ອັບເກຣດແພັກເກດ Library ຂອງທ່ານ ແລ້ວເລືອກກ່ອງໝາຍຕິກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ"

